<p class="finish-note">Same stone, three finishes available at no upcharge — polished for brightness and depth, honed for a soft matte, or leathered for a textured, low-glare surface that hides fingerprints and etching.</p>

<h3>Cristallo Quartzite — 10 slabs</h3>
<p>Completing the container is Cristallo — a dramatic, crystalline white quartzite with translucent body and striking dendritic veining in black and gold. It's a true showpiece material: backlight it for an island waterfall or a feature wall and it glows.</p>
